# Cargo build output.
#
# Unanchored on purpose: `/target` matches only the workspace root, which let
# `crates/interop/target` be committed (2,053 files, 432 MB) and purged from
# history later. `interop` is outside the workspace, so it builds into its own
# target dir — as would any future standalone crate.
target/

**/*.rs.bk

# mdbook build output. The linkcheck renderer moves the site to book/html,
# but ignore the whole tree.
docs/book/

# cargo-fuzz artifacts
fuzz/corpus/
fuzz/artifacts/
fuzz/coverage/
